p2m_open "ModularCurve P2MW.S_ModularCurve_FullLevel_tateGal_eq_one_of_mem_inertiaSubgroupIn.ModularCurve ModularCurve.FullLevel P2MW.S_ModularCurve_FullLevel_tateGal_eq_one_of_mem_inertiaSubgroupIn.ModularCurve.FullLevel"

